{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Ellcia","The Sacred Book of the land of Eija has been rediscovered and with it the legends of a mysterious and all powerful ship. Now Princess Crystal of Megaronia has set forth on a quest to recover the ship and its ultimate weaponry. All that stands between her and total domination of the world is a small group of piratical misfits. Swords, sorcery and technology blend to form a mesmerizing tale of Good vs. Evil in Ellcia.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["幻想叙譚エルシア",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-3461","ids":{"shikimori":3461,"mal":3461,"anilist":3461,"kodik":"serial-22420"},"kodikIds":["serial-22420"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-22420":"2020-02-05T00:09:31Z"},"title":"Элсия","originalTitle":"Gensou Jotan Ellcia","alt":"Ellcia / Genso jodan Elicia Ellcia 幻想叙譚エルシア","description":"Священная книга земли Эйя была открыта заново, а вместе с ней и легенды о таинственном и всемогущем корабле. Теперь принцесса Мегаронии Кристал отправилась на поиски корабля и его совершенного вооружения. Все, что стоит между ней и полным господством над миром, - это небольшая группа пиратов-неудачников. Мечи, магия и технологии сливаются воедино, образуя завораживающую историю о Добре и зле. Зло в Эллсии.","year":1992,"type":"OVA","genres":["Приключения","Фэнтези"],"rating":6.19,"popularity":1303,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/3461/9921529f515777c2b50e308ea595a287.jpeg","width":244,"height":400},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3461-AC9eJTYkIdpA.jpg","width":1900,"height":500}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"seri